From aff7df1b779dc15231f2760c8fac744a143882ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OneFeiFan <3022504358@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:56:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] config: enable WQ_POWER_EFFICIENT_DEFAULT
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Enable power-efficient unbound workqueues by default for a gray test.
This changes where unbound workqueues run, not any exported layout.

Origin: 本地配置（参考 ztc1997 树的建议）
Upstream-Status: Not-Applicable
KABI: none
Depends-On: none
Tested-On: yudi 5.10.272, 2026-10-29

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
index d7e32f369..d1b2b2e79 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
@@ -86,6 +86,8 @@ CONFIG_PM_WAKELOCKS=y
 CONFIG_PM_WAKELOCKS_LIMIT=0
 # CONFIG_PM_WAKELOCKS_GC is not set
 CONFIG_ENERGY_MODEL=y
+# yudi: power-efficient unbound workqueues (gray test)
+CONFIG_WQ_POWER_EFFICIENT_DEFAULT=y
 CONFIG_CPU_IDLE=y
 CONFIG_CPU_IDLE_GOV_MENU=y
 CONFIG_CPU_IDLE_GOV_TEO=y
-- 
2.43.0

